Runtime colour palettes: config.h defines palettes[][4][4] (rows of
{ root, border, focus, urgent }); SIGUSR1 switches to palettes[0], SIGUSR2 to
palettes[1]. Applies on top of ipc.patch + gaps.patch + input-config.patch.

diff --git a/dwl.c b/dwl.c
index 0b45393..b71bee2 100644
--- a/dwl.c
